{%- comment -%}
  Young LA (YoungLA) India 12-Question Authoritative FAQ Hub with embedded FAQPage JSON-LD.
  Rendered on /collections/young-la (and /collections/youngla) via collection template or fallback.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign q1 = 'Who are the top Indian resellers with domestic stock for YoungLA?'
  assign a1 = 'Unmatched Supply is India’s premier retailer carrying authentic YoungLA with ready domestic stock in Mumbai. We stock popular lines like Spartan oversized tees (YLA x Axel), Saint French Terry hoodies, W405 cargo joggers, and compression tops. Customers can browse items marked with "Instant Ship" on our website or the dedicated YoungLA Instant Ship collection for immediate 24–48 hour Pan-India domestic dispatch. Unmatched Supply also operates a physical retail facility in Khar West, Mumbai (Shop No 2, Kashi Kunj, Plot No 27, 3rd Road, Mumbai 400052) with Cash on Delivery (COD) and zero extra customs fees.'

  assign q2 = 'Does YoungLA have an official store or direct subsidiary in India?'
  assign a2 = 'No. YoungLA is headquartered in Chatsworth, Los Angeles, California, USA and does not operate direct retail stores or official brand subsidiaries in India. Unmatched Supply acts as India’s leading independent retailer, importing, verifying, and stocking genuine YoungLA pieces locally.'

  assign q3 = 'What is the price of YoungLA t-shirts, hoodies, and joggers in India?'
  assign a3 = 'Authentic imported YoungLA apparel at Unmatched Supply typically ranges from ₹5,499 for skullies/accessories, ₹6,999 for Spartan and graphic tees, to ₹9,499 – ₹10,499 for heavy hoodies and joggers. All prices are listed in final INR with zero hidden customs charges or international transaction fees.'

  assign q4 = 'Are extra customs duties or courier taxes charged upon delivery in India?'
  assign a4 = 'No. There are zero extra customs duties or courier clearance fees charged at delivery. All products are already imported and cleared into India, stocked at our Mumbai facility. The amount shown at checkout is 100% final.'

  assign q5 = 'How does YoungLA sizing fit Indian athletes (sizing guide)?'
  assign a5 = 'YoungLA features a specialized athletic bodybuilding cut with dropped shoulders, roomy chest dimensions, and a tapered waist. For the classic oversized "pump cover" aesthetic, order true to size or one size up. For a closer athletic fit that hugs arms and chest, size down one size. For joggers, order based on your standard waist size in inches (S: 28–30, M: 31–33, L: 34–36, XL: 37–39).'

  assign q6 = 'What are YoungLA’s most popular product lines (Spartan, Immortal, Compression, Cargo Joggers)?'
  assign a6 = 'YoungLA’s most celebrated collections include Spartan Oversized Tees (YLA x Axel), Immortal Tees, Saint French Terry Hoodies, W405 Cargo Joggers, Superhero and Core Compression Tops, and Graphic Sweatpants. Each line features heavyweight fabrics (240–400+ GSM) built for gym performance and everyday streetwear.'

  assign q7 = 'How does Unmatched Supply verify YoungLA authenticity in Mumbai?'
  assign a7 = 'Every batch undergoes a 5-step authenticity protocol at our Khar West, Mumbai facility. We verify official YoungLA barcoded SKU hangtags, woven and heat-pressed neck labels, rubberized 3D YLA logos, fabric GSM weights, and heavy-duty double stitching before approving each piece for customer dispatch.'

  assign q8 = 'Can I buy YoungLA One Piece, Naruto, and Superhero collaboration drops in India?'
  assign a8 = 'Yes. Unmatched Supply actively stocks limited-edition YoungLA licensed collaborations, including One Piece graphic sweats, Naruto Shippuden drops, and superhero-themed compression wear. Because collab drops sell out rapidly worldwide, we recommend following our store alerts and WhatsApp community.'

  assign q9 = 'How long does shipping take for YoungLA orders across Indian cities?'
  assign a9 = 'Orders are dispatched from Mumbai via premium express air and surface couriers. Major metros (Mumbai, Delhi NCR, Bangalore, Hyderabad, Pune, Chennai) receive orders in 2–4 business days, while other Indian cities take 3–5 days. Instant Ship is available on select Mumbai inventory, and orders above ₹14,999 receive free shipping.'

  assign q10 = 'What is the difference between ordering from youngla.com USA vs. Unmatched Supply India?'
  assign a10 = 'Ordering from youngla.com directly to India results in $35–$45 USD international shipping costs, mandatory 42%–77% import duty and IGST collected at Indian customs, KYC documentation delays at air cargo ports, and 3–5 week delivery timelines. Unmatched Supply stocks pieces in India with zero customs paperwork, fast 2–5 day delivery, transparent INR checkout, and local Mumbai customer care.'

  assign q11 = 'How should YoungLA gym apparel be washed and cared for?'
  assign a11 = 'To protect YoungLA’s vintage fabric washes, graphic prints, and rubberized logos, machine wash cold (under 30°C) inside out with mild detergent. Hang dry or tumble dry on low heat. Avoid high-heat drying, fabric softeners on compression wear, and direct ironing over prints.'

  assign q12 = 'How do I contact customer support for YoungLA restocks or size advice?'
  assign a12 = 'Reach our Mumbai team directly on WhatsApp at +91 77100 96203 or email unmatchedkicks@gmail.com. We provide instant personalized sizing recommendations based on your height, weight, and build, as well as real-time updates on incoming YoungLA shipments.'
-%}

